{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155660/extras/8d5f90a13ef179c1ab9b6e834c49daef.avif?t=1762384690\" width=1232 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The King is cornered; the pieces set. You remember telling him: In <i>Zugzwang,</i> there are no good moves\u2014there's only destiny. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a murderer, a wanna-be hero, a terrible lover, a boy that chases myth the way dogs chase their own tails. Just remember: you cannot save him, it <i>is</i> too late, and checkmate is all but on the board.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dramatic branching narrative</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two characters both very desperately and unfortunately in love </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10 different endings</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn art and frame-by-frame animations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Zugzwang is the debut visual novel from MALICE STUDIOS featuring  murder, romance, chess, and destiny, all delivered through simple VN and light RPG mechanics.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4155660?t=1762384690","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4155660?t=1762384690","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155660/fbd10734205f87ae0fd137c12e6e0dce998f8014/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762384690","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155660/fbd10734205f87ae0fd137c12e6e0dce998f8014/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762384690","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Content Warnings: Death, Blood, Violence, Murder, Corpse, Mildly Suggestive Language."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155660/extras/8d5f90a13ef179c1ab9b6e834c49daef.avif?t=1762384690\" width=1232 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The King is cornered; the pieces set. You remember telling him: In <i>Zugzwang,</i> there are no good moves\u2014there's only destiny. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a murderer, a wanna-be hero, a terrible lover, a boy that chases myth the way dogs chase their own tails. Just remember: you cannot save him, it <i>is</i> too late, and checkmate is all but on the board.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dramatic branching narrative</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two characters both very desperately and unfortunately in love </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10 different endings</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn art and frame-by-frame animations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Zugzwang is the debut visual novel from MALICE STUDIOS featuring  murder, romance, chess, and destiny, all delivered through simple VN and light RPG mechanics.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Malice Studios LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155660/3f2969d6113e7bda5ed215634944eef73ecff068/header.jpg?t=17623846